# NextBSD kernel events -- the Darwin PF_SYSTEM domain and its SYSPROTO_EVENT
# socket (net/kern_event_sock.c), fed by the interface and address
# EVENTHANDLERs (net/kev_net.c), nextbsd-kernel#293. Self-registering domain
# and handlers, no base patch; `standard` (always compiled), and inert until a
# socket sets a filter. Sources are laid into /usr/src/sys by the overlay cp in
# build.yml. KERNEL build only -- the modules build shares patches/series but
# not the overlay or these fragments (same rule as vfs_pivot). Never name
# these kern/kern_event*.c: build.yml appends to the base kern/kern_event.c.
net/kern_event_sock.c		standard
net/kev_net.c			standard
